          "post_id": "341807",
          "text": "Let $A$ be the set consisting of the first $2020$ terms of the arithmetic progression $1,3, 5,7,9,\\ldots,$ and $B$ be the set consisting of the first $2020$ terms of the arithmetic progression $5,10,15,20,25,30,\\ldots $. The number of elements in the set $A\\cup B$ is ________",
