        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "341817",
          "text": "<p>You are at a party with $8$ of your friends and you order a $16$-cut pizza ($16$ identical slices). How many distributions of pizza slices are there if each person gets at least one slice of pizza?</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n\t<li>$6435$</li>\n\t<li>$6433$</li>\n\t<li>$6437$</li>\n\t<li>$6439$</li>\n</ol>",
