        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "341835",
          "text": "<p>The following propositional statement is a<br>\n$\\ \\neg(\\neg A \\wedge B)\\leftrightarrow (A\\rightarrow B)$</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n\t<li>Tautology</li>\n\t<li>Contradiction</li>\n\t<li>Contingent</li>\n\t<li>More than one of these</li>\n</ol>",
