        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "341843",
          "text": "<p>The $\\underline{\\text{sanctimonious}}$ priest would only believe himself.</p>\n\n<p>Which of the following does the underlined word NOT mean?</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n\t<li>self-righteous</li>\n\t<li>pharisaic</li>\n\t<li>older</li>\n\t<li>morally superior</li>\n</ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "c",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.3333",
          "tags": "go2026-mix-1,normal,verbal-aptitude,word-meaning",
          "category": "Verbal Aptitude"
        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "341793",
          "text": "<p>The number of topological orderings possible for the following hasse diagram is _________<br>\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"313\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"169\"></p>",
          "type": "Numerical",
          "answer": "12",
          "award": 2,
