          "text": "<p>In recent months, Mr. Trump and other officials in the US administration had attacked China _______&nbsp;its handling of the COVID-$19$ pandemic.</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n\t<li>from</li>\n\t<li>over</li>\n\t<li>of</li>\n\t<li>across</li>\n</ol>",
