          "text": "<p>How many triangles can be formed by $15$ points of which $6$ are collinear?</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n\t<li>$455$</li>\n\t<li>$445$</li>\n\t<li>$452$</li>\n\t<li>$435$</li>\n</ol>",
